.env*
.xeno/local/
/xeno
/dist/

# The plugin tree the release copies in before it builds, so that a released binary can
# vendor what its digest was taken over. Generated, never committed: the directory above it
# is tracked because go:embed needs it to exist at compile time, and this is the part a
# release writes (#199).
internal/plugin/embedded/plugin/

# The git worktrees an agent session creates, each a repository of its own. Generated,
# never committed: unignored, `git add -A` stages one as a gitlink, which records
# somebody else's commit sha, carries none of the content and resolves to nothing in a
# fresh clone. It reached a commit's index once (#309) and was caught in the diffstat.
/.claude/worktrees/
